id: SAVE5-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: reload_after_control
target: crates/core/src/stop.rs
find:     let mut run = entry.run.clone();
replace:     let _ = entry; let mut run = state.run.clone();
expect-fail: reload_right_after_stop_restores_the_stopped_state
note: 停止で Step の入口の写しへ戻さず、処理の途中の実行状態を残す。停止の直後の状態が入口にならず、再読み込みの後も入口と等しくない
